      "descriptions": {
        "shortDescriptionText": "<p>Take off aboard an exhilarating flight where you can witness the wonders of the world as never before!</p>",
        "shortDescriptionMobileText": "Soaring Over the Horizon - Presented by China UnionPay\n<br>\nAscend to the mystical Arbori observatory on Adventure Isle. Through ancient tribal magic, you’ll be transported on a thrilling flight around the world to view the planet’s most breathtaking sights."
      },
      "entityCards": [
        {
          "cardType": "StoryCard",
          "cardData": [
            {
              "header": "Enter the Realm of the Sky",
              "text": "<p>Summoning ancient primal powers, you’ll ascend on a magical journey for a breathtaking view of the planet.</p>\n<p>Follow the trail to the Arbori tribe’s celestial observatory—said to be an enchanted portal connecting the physical and mystical worlds. Inside, shamans channel the spirit of the condor to help adventurers realize one of mankind’s most ancient and elusive dreams: to soar like a bird.</p>\n<p>Gather before an enormous radiant black stone—through which visions are revealed—and prepare to be transported. On a hilltop high above Adventure Isle, you’re about to embark on the greatest adventure of all.</p>",
              "media": [
                {
                  "type": "image/jpeg",
                  "title": "",
                  "url": "https://static.shanghaidisneyresort.com/tridion/prod/en/system/images/shdr-att-soaring-01-new_tcm1871-114879.jpg",
                  "width": 170,
                  "height": 96
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "cardType": "StoryCard",
          "cardData": [
            {
              "header": "A Sensational Journey Around the World ",
              "text": "<p>Enjoy a spectacular view featuring a few of the Earth’s most incredible sights.</p>\n<p><strong>Positively Sensational!</strong>\n<br />\nWith the wind in your face and treetops and rooftops whizzing beneath you, Soaring Over the Horizon is literally an uplifting experience. Marvel at the vistas and thrill to the freedom—and elation—as you’re whisked around the globe on a flight that feels truly magical.</p>\n<p><strong>A Disney Parks Favorite Taken to New Heights</strong>\n<br />\nA “Soaring” attraction has been delighting Disney theme park Guests in the United States for years: first at Disney California Adventure Park and then at Epcot at Walt Disney World Resort. In those versions, the giant-screen projection technology simulates a flight over California.</p>\n<p>Here in China, we’ve created an entirely new experience that goes beyond anything before. Prepare to be transported on an incredible round-the-world journey—“flying” from Adventure Isle over Earth’s iconic landmarks, cities and natural attractions.</p>",
              "media": [
                {
                  "type": "image/jpeg",
                  "title": "",
                  "url": "https://static.shanghaidisneyresort.com/tridion/prod/en/system/images/shdr-att-soaring-02-new_tcm1871-114878.jpg",
                  "width": 170,
                  "height": 96
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
